# Live first-encounter coverage for DoNormalSenseAction's airborne branch.
# Attack 6 carries authored reaction type 1 and the knife thug is directly in
# front. IsInAir therefore bypasses the close counter and native random(100)
# chooses the perpendicular state-36/state-37 pair. At the native 20 Hz
# opening cadence, the shared shipped stream reaches its 0--50 branch at this
# point and therefore selects state 36.
fixed_step_ms 50
sample_interval_ms 50
capture_interval_ms 0
max_time_ms 80000
start_time_ms 53033
render_size 640 360

wait_gameplay 60000
teleport 14172 -7978 7 -0.416 -0.909 0
move_until_cinematic 14067 -8205 7 71 10000
wait_enemies_active 5000 394 395 397
set_enemy_ai 395 0
set_enemy_ai 397 0
teleport 13399 -6650 7 0 1 0
wait_enemy_melee_attack 10000 394
jump
unlock_skill 1
spider_sense
